,"name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Pubs","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"54b_ZM23HJhw7L1_D-nRkw","review_id":"BmDXe-IpyIMO0jEGArj5mw","date":"2015-11-08T01:06:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.944743812084198,"text_excerpt":"Came here on a Monday for happy hour. Fantastic bar and great service. It looks a bit hipster-ish but the bartender was nice and they had a few happy hour specials ($3 Old Fashioned! Not the best I've ever had but did the job). They also have an impressive collection of whiskeys, bourbons, and scotches. The drink list is organized by country of origin. Music wasn't too loud so it was great for having conversations. Very low-lighting so it gives it a bit of a romantic vibe, too. Very cool place overall."},{"business_id":"54b_ZM23HJhw7L1_D-nRkw","review_id":"FxAc6v83u8bcM1DNXq8X_w","date":"2015-11-02T02:09:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9413149356842041,"text_excerpt":"This place is a step up from the old bridge lounge. Stopped in for a pre dinner drink. They have a full service bar with a focus on bourbon/whiskey. My husband said his cocktail was one of the best he's ever had. The cocktail list is short, but if you don't see what you want, just ask and they will make it for you. Inside, it's quite dark, but they do offer outdoor seating on magazine which is nice."},{"business_id":"54b_ZM23HJhw7L1_D-nRkw","review_id":"0oIMu-DAzT3cpzIcwvgMcQ","date":"2018-06-12T21:46:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9393993616104126,"text_excerpt":"Came here with a few friends one night to check out this whisky bar. I always wanted to try this place, but I was thinking that I would just be sipping on straight whiskey. I was shocked at what this place had to offer! This place is pretty awesome with people always at the bar ordering their tasty drinks. There were plenty of tables and couches for people to socialize and drink. Each table has a drink menu and a candle to set the mood. The place is dark, intimate, and lively with people just having a great time. We started off with the House Old Fashioned and it was strong, just like how I like it. As we sipped and chilled, the ice would melt and the old fashioned was a lot more enjoyabl..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"54b_ZM23HJhw7L1_D-nRkw","photo_id":"ku_Gp8Fko5Z00VMfTCW1Pw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ku_Gp8Fko5Z00VMfTCW1Pw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9257969260215759},{"business_id":"54b_ZM23HJhw7L1_D-nRkw","photo_id":"MK5s6QoMO271uAPlot6vOg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/MK5s6QoMO271uAPlot6vOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8657042980194092},{"business_id":"54b_ZM23HJhw7L1_D-nRkw","photo_id":"uwbKw0Ks5unefVcQ3jTA2w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/uwbKw0Ks5unefVcQ3jTA2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.865566611289978},{"business_id":"54b_ZM23HJhw7L1_D-nRkw","photo_id":"91YV6BRir-ZaS-eJFjBURQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/91YV6BRir-ZaS-eJFjBURQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8575836420059204},{"business_id":"54b_ZM23HJhw7L1_D-nRkw","photo_id":"59IRYjM3lIhcxwgLMHgYhQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/59IRYjM3lIhcxwgLMHgYhQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6437157392501831}]},"notebook_case":null}
